<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" class="dark">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>IsaiPulse Hi-Res Tamil Lossless Launcher</title>
    
    <!-- Tailwind CSS CDN -->
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <script>
        tailwind.config = {
            darkMode: 'class',
            theme: {
                extend: {
                    colors: {
                        brand: {
                            50: '#f0f9ff',
                            400: '#38bdf8',
                            500: '#06b6d4',
                            600: '#0284c7',
                            900: '#0f172a',
                            gold: '#fbbf24',
                            accent: '#f43f5e'
                        }
                    },
                    fontFamily: {
                        sans: ['Inter', 'sans-serif'],
                    },
                    animation: {
                        'spin-slow': 'spin 20s linear infinite',
                        'pulse-glow': 'pulseGlow 2s infinite alternate',
                    },
                    keyframes: {
                        pulseGlow: {
                            '0%': { boxShadow: '0 0 15px rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.2)' },
                            '100%': { boxShadow: '0 0 35px rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.6)' }
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    </script>

    <!-- Lucide Icons -->
    <script src="https://unpkg.com/lucide@latest"></script>

    <!-- Google Font: Inter -->
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            background: #090d16;
            color: #f8fafc;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        /* Glassmorphism Styles */
        .glass-panel {
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75);
            backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
        }

        .glass-card {
            background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.5);
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
        }

        /* Custom Scrollbar */
        ::-webkit-scrollbar {
            width: 6px;
            height: 6px;
        }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6);
        }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
            background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.3);
            border-radius: 4px;
        }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {
            background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.6);
        }

        /* Vinyl Spin animation pause toggle */
        .paused {
            animation-play-state: paused !important;
        }

        /* Range Slider Styling */
        input[type=range] {
            -webkit-appearance: none;
            background: transparent;
        }
        input[type=range]:focus {
            outline: none;
        }
        input[type=range]::-webkit-slider-runnable-track {
            width: 100%;
            height: 6px;
            cursor: pointer;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
            border-radius: 3px;
        }
        input[type=range]::-webkit-slider-thumb {
            height: 14px;
            width: 14px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: #38bdf8;
            cursor: pointer;
            -webkit-appearance: none;
            margin-top: -4px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.8);
            transition: transform 0.1s ease, background-color 0.1s ease;
        }
        input[type=range]::-webkit-slider-thumb:hover {
            transform: scale(1.2);
            background: #7dd3fc;
        }

        /* Vertical range slider for EQ */
        .eq-slider {
            writing-mode: bt-linear; /* IE/Edge */
            -webkit-appearance: slider-vertical; /* WebKit */
            width: 8px;
            height: 140px;
            padding: 0 5px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="min-h-screen flex flex-col justify-between selection:bg-brand-400 selection:text-slate-900">

    <!-- Ambient Background Glows -->
    <div class="fixed top-0 left-1/4 w-96 h-96 bg-brand-600/20 rounded-full blur-[120px] pointer-events-none -z-10"></div>
    <div class="fixed bottom-0 right-1/4 w-96 h-96 bg-brand-accent/15 rounded-full blur-[140px] pointer-events-none -z-10"></div>

    <!-- Header Navigation -->
    <header class="w-full glass-panel sticky top-0 z-40 px-4 lg:px-8 py-3 flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10">
        <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-tr from-brand-600 to-brand-400 flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg shadow-brand-500/20">
                <i data-lucide="disc-3" class="w-6 h-6 text-slate-900 animate-spin-slow"></i>
            </div>
            <div>
                <h1 class="font-extrabold text-lg lg:text-xl tracking-tight bg-gradient-to-r from-white via-slate-200 to-brand-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent">
                    IsaiPulse <span class="text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-brand-400/10 text-brand-400 border border-brand-400/30 font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase ml-1">Hi-Res FLAC</span>
                </h1>
                <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 hidden sm:block">Bit-Perfect Tamil Lossless Streaming & Audio Engine</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Action Tools -->
        <div class="flex items-center space-x-2 sm:space-x-3">
            <!-- Local File Upload Button -->
            <label for="localFileInput" class="cursor-pointer flex items-center space-x-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-800/80 hover:bg-slate-700 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium border border-white/10 text-slate-200 transition-all">
                <i data-lucide="folder-plus" class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-400"></i>
                <span class="hidden md:inline">Open FLAC/WAV</span>
                <input type="file" id="localFileInput" accept="audio/*,.flac,.wav,.m4a,.mp3" class="hidden" multiple>
            </label>

            <!-- EQ Toggle Modal Button -->
            <button id="btnOpenEQ" class="flex items-center space-x-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-800/80 hover:bg-slate-700 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium border border-white/10 text-slate-200 transition-all">
                <i data-lucide="sliders" class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-gold"></i>
                <span class="hidden md:inline">Equalizer</span>
            </button>

            <!-- Bit-Perfect Setup Guide Modal Button -->
            <button id="btnOpenSetup" class="p-2 rounded-lg bg-slate-800/80 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 border border-white/10 transition-all" title="Bit-Perfect Audio Setup Guide">
                <i data-lucide="settings-2" class="w-4 h-4"></i>
            </button>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Main Content Container -->
    <main class="max-w-7xl w-full mx-auto p-4 lg:p-6 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-6 flex-grow">
        
        <!-- Left Section: Visualizer & Player Hub (7 cols on large screens) -->
        <section class="lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col space-y-6">
            
            <!-- Vinyl & Visualizer Stage Card -->
            <div class="glass-panel rounded-2xl p-6 flex flex-col items-center justify-between relative overflow-hidden shadow-2xl min-h-[380px]">
                
                <!-- Audio Specs & Stream Quality Badge Header -->
                <div class="w-full flex justify-between items-center z-10">
                    <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
                        <span id="badgeFormat" class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-rose-500/20 text-rose-300 border border-rose-500/40 text-xs font-bold tracking-wider uppercase">
                            24-BIT / 96kHz FLAC
                        </span>
                        <span id="badgeChannel" class="px-2 py-1 rounded-md bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 text-xs font-mono border border-white/5">
                            STEREO 2.0
                        </span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex items-center space-x-2 text-xs font-mono text-brand-400 bg-brand-900/60 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-brand-500/20">
                        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 animate-ping"></span>
                        <span id="audioEngineStatus">DSP ACTIVE</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Central Spinning Vinyl & Art Showcase -->
                <div class="relative my-6 flex items-center justify-center">
                    <!-- Vinyl Record Disk Effect -->
                    <div id="vinylDisk" class="w-48 h-48 sm:w-56 sm:h-56 rounded-full bg-slate-950 border-4 border-slate-800 shadow-2xl flex items-center justify-center animate-spin-slow paused transition-all duration-700 relative">
                        <!-- Vinyl Grooves -->
                        <div class="absolute inset-2 rounded-full border border-white/5"></div>
                        <div class="absolute inset-6 rounded-full border border-white/5"></div>
                        <div class="absolute inset-10 rounded-full border border-white/5"></div>
                        <div class="absolute inset-14 rounded-full border border-white/5"></div>
                        <!-- Vinyl Center Art -->
                        <img id="trackCover" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1511671782779-c97d3d27a1d4?w=500&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80" alt="Album Art" class="w-24 h-24 sm:w-28 sm:h-28 rounded-full object-cover border-2 border-slate-900 shadow-inner">
                        <div class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-slate-900 border-2 border-slate-700 absolute"></div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Real-time Frequency Spectrum Visualizer Canvas -->
                <div class="w-full relative h-24 rounded-xl overflow-hidden bg-slate-950/60 border border-white/5">
                    <canvas id="visualizerCanvas" class="w-full h-full block"></canvas>
                    <div class="absolute bottom-1 left-3 text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-widest pointer-events-none">
                        Real-time Spectrum Analyzer (Web Audio API)
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Track Metadata Banner -->
                <div class="w-full text-center mt-4 z-10">
                    <h2 id="trackTitle" class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight truncate">
                        Select a Hi-Res Track
                    </h2>
                    <p id="trackArtist" class="text-sm text-slate-400 font-medium truncate mt-0.5">
                        Tamil Lossless Master Collection
                    </p>
                    <p id="trackAlbum" class="text-xs text-brand-400/80 font-mono mt-1">
                        Album Info
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Player Control Bar -->
            <div class="glass-panel rounded-2xl p-5 space-y-4 shadow-xl">
                
                <!-- Seek Bar with Timers -->
                <div class="space-y-1">
                    <div class="flex justify-between text-xs font-mono text-slate-400">
                        <span id="currentTime">00:00</span>
                        <span id="durationTime">00:00</span>
                    </div>
                    <input type="range" id="seekBar" min="0" max="100" value="0" class="w-full">
                </div>

                <!-- Main Buttons Grid -->
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between pt-1">
                    
                    <!-- Left Secondary Controls (Shuffle / Repeat) -->
                    <div class="flex items-center space-x-1 sm:space-x-2">
                        <button id="btnShuffle" class="p-2.5 rounded-full hover:bg-slate-800 text-slate-400 hover:text-white transition-all" title="Toggle Shuffle">
                            <i data-lucide="shuffle" class="w-4 h-4"></i>
                        </button>
                        <button id="btnRepeat" class="p-2.5 rounded-full hover:bg-slate-800 text-slate-400 hover:text-white transition-all" title="Toggle Repeat">
                            <i data-lucide="repeat" class="w-4 h-4"></i>
                        </button>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Main Transport Controls -->
                    <div class="flex items-center space-x-3 sm:space-x-4">
                        <button id="btnPrev" class="p-3 rounded-full hover:bg-slate-800 text-slate-200 hover:text-brand-400 transition-all active:scale-95" title="Previous Track">
                            <i data-lucide="skip-back" class="w-5 h-5 fill-current"></i>
                        </button>

                        <button id="btnPlay" class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-tr from-brand-600 to-brand-400 hover:from-brand-500 hover:to-sky-300 text-slate-950 flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg shadow-brand-500/30 transition-all hover:scale-105 active:scale-95" title="Play/Pause">
                            <i data-lucide="play" id="playIcon" class="w-6 h-6 fill-current ml-0.5"></i>
                        </button>

                        <button id="btnNext" class="p-3 rounded-full hover:bg-slate-800 text-slate-200 hover:text-brand-400 transition-all active:scale-95" title="Next Track">
                            <i data-lucide="skip-forward" class="w-5 h-5 fill-current"></i>
                        </button>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Volume Control Block -->
                    <div class="flex items-center space-x-2 group relative">
                        <button id="btnMute" class="p-2 rounded-full hover:bg-slate-800 text-slate-400 hover:text-white transition-all">
                            <i data-lucide="volume-2" id="volumeIcon" class="w-4 h-4"></i>
                        </button>
                        <input type="range" id="volumeBar" min="0" max="1" step="0.01" value="0.8" class="w-16 sm:w-20">
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Right Section: Interactive Tamil Hi-Res Playlist & Browser (5 cols) -->
        <section class="lg:col-span-5 flex flex-col space-y-4">
            
            <div class="glass-panel rounded-2xl p-5 flex flex-col h-full min-h-[500px] shadow-xl">
                
                <!-- Playlist Header & Category Filters -->
                <div class="space-y-3 pb-4 border-b border-white/10">
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                        <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-white flex items-center space-x-2">
                            <i data-lucide="list-music" class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-400"></i>
                            <span>Lossless Catalogue</span>
                        </h3>
                        <span id="trackCountBadge" class="text-xs px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-slate-800 text-slate-400 border border-white/5 font-mono">0 tracks</span>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Search Input Box -->
                    <div class="relative">
                        <i data-lucide="search" class="w-4 h-4 absolute left-3 top-3 text-slate-400 pointer-events-none"></i>
                        <input type="text" id="searchInput" placeholder="Search song, composer, era, or album..." class="w-full bg-slate-900/80 border border-white/10 rounded-xl pl-9 pr-4 py-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-200 placeholder-slate-500 focus:outline-none focus:border-brand-400 transition-all">
                    </div>

                    <!-- Filter Tags (Composer & Era Filter Tabs) -->
                    <div class="flex items-center space-x-1.5 overflow-x-auto pb-1 text-xs no-scrollbar">
                        <button class="filter-btn px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-brand-500 text-slate-950 font-semibold whitespace-nowrap transition-all" data-filter="all">All</button>
                        <button class="filter-btn px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 hover:bg-slate-700 whitespace-nowrap transition-all" data-filter="ARR">A.R. Rahman</button>
                        <button class="filter-btn px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 hover:bg-slate-700 whitespace-nowrap transition-all" data-filter="Raja">Ilaiyaraaja</button>
                        <button class="filter-btn px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 hover:bg-slate-700 whitespace-nowrap transition-all" data-filter="Anirudh">Anirudh / Harris</button>
                        <button class="filter-btn px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 hover:bg-slate-700 whitespace-nowrap transition-all" data-filter="90s">90s Gold</button>
                        <button class="filter-btn px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 hover:bg-slate-700 whitespace-nowrap transition-all" data-filter="Classics">80s Classics</button>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Playlist Scrollable Items List -->
                <div id="playlistContainer" class="flex-grow overflow-y-auto space-y-2 py-3 pr-1 max-h-[420px]">
                    <!-- Playlist tracks dynamically generated here -->
                </div>

                <!-- Footer Audio Engine Stats Info -->
                <div class="pt-3 border-t border-white/10 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-400">
                    <span class="flex items-center space-x-1">
                        <i data-lucide="cpu" class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-brand-400"></i>
                        <span>Web Audio Engine v2.4</span>
                    </span>
                    <span id="sampleRateDisplay" class="text-slate-300">48000 Hz / 24-Bit</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <!-- Modal 1: 5-Band Equalizer Modal -->
    <div id="eqModal" class="fixed inset-0 bg-slate-950/80 backdrop-filter backdrop-blur-md z-50 flex items-center justify-center p-4 hidden">
        <div class="glass-panel rounded-2xl w-full max-w-lg p-6 border border-white/10 shadow-2xl space-y-6">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 pb-3">
                <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
                    <i data-lucide="sliders" class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-gold"></i>
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-white">5-Band Studio Equalizer</h3>
                </div>
                <button id="btnCloseEQ" class="text-slate-400 hover:text-white p-1">
                    <i data-lucide="x" class="w-5 h-5"></i>
                </button>
            </div>

            <!-- Equalizer Band Sliders Grid -->
            <div class="grid grid-cols-5 gap-2 sm:gap-4 text-center">
                <!-- 60Hz - Sub Bass -->
                <div class="flex flex-col items-center space-y-2 bg-slate-900/50 p-2 rounded-xl border border-white/5">
                    <span class="text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-400">+12dB</span>
                    <input type="range" min="-12" max="12" step="0.5" value="0" class="eq-band eq-slider" data-band="0">
                    <span class="text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-400">-12dB</span>
                    <span class="text-xs font-bold text-brand-400 mt-1">60 Hz</span>
                    <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-500">Sub Bass</span>
                </div>

                <!-- 250Hz - Bass -->
                <div class="flex flex-col items-center space-y-2 bg-slate-900/50 p-2 rounded-xl border border-white/5">
                    <span class="text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-400">+12dB</span>
                    <input type="range" min="-12" max="12" step="0.5" value="0" class="eq-band eq-slider" data-band="1">
                    <span class="text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-400">-12dB</span>
                    <span class="text-xs font-bold text-brand-400 mt-1">250 Hz</span>
                    <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-500">Bass</span>
                </div>

                <!-- 1kHz - Mids -->
                <div class="flex flex-col items-center space-y-2 bg-slate-900/50 p-2 rounded-xl border border-white/5">
                    <span class="text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-400">+12dB</span>
                    <input type="range" min="-12" max="12" step="0.5" value="0" class="eq-band eq-slider" data-band="2">
                    <span class="text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-400">-12dB</span>
                    <span class="text-xs font-bold text-brand-400 mt-1">1 kHz</span>
                    <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-500">Mids</span>
                </div>

                <!-- 4kHz - Highs -->
                <div class="flex flex-col items-center space-y-2 bg-slate-900/50 p-2 rounded-xl border border-white/5">
                    <span class="text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-400">+12dB</span>
                    <input type="range" min="-12" max="12" step="0.5" value="0" class="eq-band eq-slider" data-band="3">
                    <span class="text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-400">-12dB</span>
                    <span class="text-xs font-bold text-brand-400 mt-1">4 kHz</span>
                    <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-500">Highs</span>
                </div>

                <!-- 12kHz - Treble / Air -->
                <div class="flex flex-col items-center space-y-2 bg-slate-900/50 p-2 rounded-xl border border-white/5">
                    <span class="text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-400">+12dB</span>
                    <input type="range" min="-12" max="12" step="0.5" value="0" class="eq-band eq-slider" data-band="4">
                    <span class="text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-400">-12dB</span>
                    <span class="text-xs font-bold text-brand-400 mt-1">12 kHz</span>
                    <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-500">Air</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- EQ Presets -->
            <div class="space-y-2">
                <label class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider">Presets</label>
                <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                    <button class="eq-preset-btn px-3 py-1 rounded-lg bg-brand-500/20 text-brand-300 border border-brand-500/30 text-xs font-medium hover:bg-brand-500/30" data-preset="flat">Flat</button>
                    <button class="eq-preset-btn px-3 py-1 rounded-lg bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 border border-white/5 text-xs font-medium hover:bg-slate-700" data-preset="bass">Bass Boost</button>
                    <button class="eq-preset-btn px-3 py-1 rounded-lg bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 border border-white/5 text-xs font-medium hover:bg-slate-700" data-preset="clarity">Vocal Clarity</button>
                    <button class="eq-preset-btn px-3 py-1 rounded-lg bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 border border-white/5 text-xs font-medium hover:bg-slate-700" data-preset="acoustic">Acoustic / Strings</button>
                    <button class="eq-preset-btn px-3 py-1 rounded-lg bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 border border-white/5 text-xs font-medium hover:bg-slate-700" data-preset="treble">Hi-Res Air Boost</button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Modal 2: Bit-Perfect OS Sound Configuration Setup Modal -->
    <div id="setupModal" class="fixed inset-0 bg-slate-950/80 backdrop-filter backdrop-blur-md z-50 flex items-center justify-center p-4 hidden">
        <div class="glass-panel rounded-2xl w-full max-w-2xl p-6 border border-white/10 shadow-2xl space-y-5 max-h-[90vh] overflow-y-auto">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 pb-3">
                <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
                    <i data-lucide="shield-check" class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-400"></i>
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-white">Bit-Perfect OS Setup Guide</h3>
                </div>
                <button id="btnCloseSetup" class="text-slate-400 hover:text-white p-1">
                    <i data-lucide="x" class="w-5 h-5"></i>
                </button>
            </div>

            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
                To experience true uncompressed 24-bit / 96kHz or 192kHz audio without OS resampling degradation, ensure your Operating System audio settings match your DAC/Headphone output capabilities:
            </p>

            <!-- OS Instructions Tabs/Grid -->
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-xs">
                <!-- Windows Configuration -->
                <div class="bg-slate-900/80 p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/10 space-y-2">
                    <div class="flex items-center space-x-2 text-brand-400 font-bold">
                        <i data-lucide="monitor" class="w-4 h-4"></i>
                        <span>Windows OS Configuration</span>
                    </div>
                    <ol class="list-decimal list-inside space-y-1 text-slate-300 leading-normal">
                        <li>Press <code class="bg-slate-800 px-1 rounded text-brand- gold">Win + R</code>, type <code class="bg-slate-800 px-1 rounded">mmsys.cpl</code> and press Enter.</li>
                        <li>Select your active Audio Output/DAC and click <strong>Properties</strong>.</li>
                        <li>Navigate to the <strong>Advanced</strong> tab.</li>
                        <li>Set Default Format to <strong>24-bit, 96000 Hz (Studio Quality)</strong> or <strong>24-bit, 192000 Hz</strong>.</li>
                        <li>Check both <strong>Exclusive Mode</strong> options.</li>
                    </ol>
                </div>

                <!-- macOS Configuration -->
                <div class="bg-slate-900/80 p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/10 space-y-2">
                    <div class="flex items-center space-x-2 text-brand-accent font-bold">
                        <i data-lucide="laptop" class="w-4 h-4"></i>
                        <span>macOS Configuration</span>
                    </div>
                    <ol class="list-decimal list-inside space-y-1 text-slate-300 leading-normal">
